# The current authoritative bundle. A judge who clones the repository must be
# able to open /dashboard and see the LATEST verified run, not only the older
# ones, so the same seven files the manifest hashes are committed. The three
# provenance snapshots are included as well: they were written BEFORE the first
# trial, so they are the record of how the run was configured, and they did not
# exist when the bundles above were produced.
#   python -m scripts.experiments.main plan      authoritative_20260926_1000
#   python -m scripts.experiments.main preflight authoritative_20260926_1000
#   python -m scripts.experiments.main run       authoritative_20260926_1000
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/
data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/*
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/metrics.json
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/validation.json
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/trials.jsonl
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/evidence_manifest.json
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/code_fingerprint.json
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/experiment_config.json
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/seed_manifest.json
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/environment.json
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/prompt_manifest.json
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/repo_manifest.json
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/preflight.json
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/run_summary.json
!data/experiments/authoritative_20260926_1000/trajectory.jsonl

# Enforcement ablation: deterministic and offline, so the reference copy is
# committed for judges. Regenerate with:
#   python -m scripts.experiments.enforcement_ablation enforcement_ablation_reference
!data/experiments/enforcement_ablation_reference/
data/experiments/enforcement_ablation_reference/*
!data/experiments/enforcement_ablation_reference/ablation.json
!data/experiments/enforcement_ablation_reference/ablation.md

# Internal working notes and superseded local checksum manifest
SUMMARY.md
release/MANIFEST.sha256
